+# A readable review
+
+A **small change** with *clear intent* and `inline code`.
+
+## Features
+
+| Feature | State |
+| --- | --- |
+| Rich Markdown | Planned |
+| Source comments | Available |
+
+1. Open the patch.
+2. Select **Preview**.
+   - Compare both sides.
+   - Return to Source to comment.
+
+> A review should explain why the code changed.
+
+```elixir
+{:ok, :preview}
+```
+
+[Read about Markdown](https://commonmark.org/)
+
+---
+
+### Literal HTML
+
+<script>alert("This is displayed as text")</script>
